# Employee Payroll Analysis Dashboard 📊

## 📌 Project Overview

The Employee Payroll Analysis Dashboard is an Excel-based project designed to calculate employee earnings, track overtime, summarize monthly payroll expenses, and present key payroll insights through charts and KPI metrics.

The project demonstrates practical Excel skills in payroll calculations, data analysis, and dashboard development.

## 🎯 Project Objectives

- Calculate weekly employee pay and overtime bonuses.
- Track employee working hours and overtime.
- Analyze total monthly payroll expenses.
- Identify the highest-paid employee and average employee pay.
- Present payroll information through a visual dashboard.

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Microsoft Excel Online
- Excel formulas and functions
- Charts and data visualization
- Dashboard design and formatting

## 📊 Dashboard KPIs

The dashboard summarizes the following payroll metrics:

| KPI | Value |
|---|---:|
| Total January Payroll | $55,045.00 |
| Number of Employees | 10 |
| Average Employee Pay | $5,504.50 |
| Total Overtime Hours | 141 |
| Highest Employee Pay | $8,971.00 |
