## 🧮 Excel Functions Used

- `SUM()` — Calculates total payroll and overtime hours.
- `AVERAGE()` — Calculates average employee pay.
- `MAX()` — Identifies the highest employee pay.
- `COUNTA()` — Counts the employees in the dataset.
- `IF()` — Calculates overtime hours when weekly hours exceed 40.
- Cell references — Connects the payroll data to dashboard calculations and charts.

## 🔍 Key Insights

- The payroll workbook tracks 10 employees.
- Total January payroll is $55,045.00.
- Average employee pay is $5,504.50.
- Employees recorded 141 overtime hours in total.
- The highest January employee pay is $8,971.00.

